<Base title="Talent calculator" description="WoW Forever talent calculator with shareable build links.">
  <h1>Talent calculator</h1>
  <p class="lede">Plan a WoW Forever build and share it as a link. Built from the Forever game client's own talent tables, so every rank shows what it really does.</p>
  <div class="callout"><p>The calculator is being wired up to Forever's talent data. Until it's live, the <a href="/guides/">leveling guides</a> list the talents each route was written for.</p></div>
</Base>
